.SH NAME
SystemEx.Collections.Generic.PriorityQueue< TElement, TPriority > \- A Simple priority queue implemented \&. 
.br
 Elements are stored as \fBPair<T, TU>\fP where \fRT\fP is the value and \fRTU\fP is the priority\&. 
.br
 Supports enqueue, dequeue, peek, priority updates, cloning, and median‑based selection\&.  

