.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 
A Simple priority queue implemented \&. 
.br
 Elements are stored as \fBPair<T, TU>\fP where \fRT\fP is the value and \fRTU\fP is the priority\&. 
.br
 Supports enqueue, dequeue, peek, priority updates, cloning, and median‑based selection\&. 


.PP
\fBTemplate Parameters\fP
.RS 4
\fITElement\fP The stored value type\&.
.br
\fITPriority\fP The priority type, must implement INumber<TU> to allow arithmetic and comparison operations\&. 
.RE
.PP

.PP
\fBType Constraints\fP
.TP
\fITPriority\fP : \fIINumber<TPriority>\fP
.TP
\fITElement\fP : \fInotnull\fP
